<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12216" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁπλότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>singleness,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς φωνῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Aud.</u>
					801a19
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>simplicity,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					6.1.18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὴν μουσικήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					404e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς τροφῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					3.17
				</span></i>
			: of literarystyle, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				9.14
			</span></i>: pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁπλότητες λόγων</span>
			ibid. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
				<i>simplicity, frankness, sincerity,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.4.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Wi.</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.78.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.66
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ εἰς τὸν Χριστὸν ἁ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
					11.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>open-heartedness</i>: hence, <i>liberality,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				8.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.11
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.1517
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
